	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "bf556b61-73f7-44ca-8b54-b37ebf2f8657",
		"name": "Theia Mobile Backend - WebSocket RPC",
		"description": "WebSocket RPC methods for Theia Mobile Backend. Use Postman's WebSocket support to test these requests.\n\n## Connection\nConnect to: ws://localhost:3030/mobile\n\n## Protocol\nAll messages are JSON-encoded following the Mobile RPC Protocol:\n- **Request**: `{\"id\": \"<uuid>\", \"method\": \"<method>\", \"params\": [...]}`\n- **Response**: `{\"id\": \"<uuid>\", \"result\": {...}}` or `{\"id\": \"<uuid>\", \"error\": {...}}`\n- **Notification**: `{\"method\": \"<method>\", \"params\": [...]}`",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_uid": "24359012-bf556b61-73f7-44ca-8b54-b37ebf2f8657"
	},
