							"host": [
								"{{host}}"
							],
							"port": "{{port}}",
							"path": [
								"mobile"
							]
						},
						"description": "Restore a previously created session.\n\n**Request**:\n- `sessionId`: Previous session ID\n- `clientId`: Client identifier\n\n**Response**:\n- `sessionId`: Restored session ID\n- `workspace`: Workspace URI\n- `openFiles`: Array of open file URIs\n- `activeFile`: Active file URI\n- `profileId`: Active language profile ID"
					},
					"response": []
				},
